  sequenceDiagram
      actor Clinician
      participant OpenMRS
      participant CDSS as CDSS Service
      participant Snowstorm as Snowstorm Lite (SNOMED-CT)

      Clinician->>OpenMRS: Enter medication prescription
      OpenMRS->>CDSS: REST — drug codes + patient conditions
      CDSS->>Snowstorm: FHIR terminology lookup (SNOMED concepts)
      Snowstorm-->>CDSS: Concept details
      CDSS->>CDSS: Apply rule sheets (drug-drug, drug-condition)
      CDSS-->>OpenMRS: Alerts / contraindication cards
      OpenMRS-->>Clinician: Show warning in UI
